	"identifying_description": "Woman's reception or dinner dress of pale apricot-colored silk gauze weave with supplementary weft-patterning in princess-line silhouette. Bodice with V-neck and 12-button front closure; pale apricot-colored silk taffeta elbow-length sleeves. Full skirt trimmed with silk and chenille fringe with bustle and slight train at back; two hook and eye closures at back of skirt. Cream-colored silk twill lining throughout.",
